Package: statcheckml
Title: R Port of statcheck-ml
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rasoul", "Norouzi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rslnorouzi@gmail.com")
Description: A port of statcheck-ml, a machine-learned replacement for the
    extraction step of the R package statcheck. The package reads a shared
    kit of rules and a trained model exported by the mother project, and
    runs the normalisation and extraction stages that turn text read from a
    PDF into reported statistical test results.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    digest,
    stats
Suggests:
    pdftools,
    R.utils,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
